  "bio": "Stepping into Pumpkeen Juice's studio in Toulouse, France, one is immediately struck by the impeccable cleanliness that surrounds the creative space. Specializing in intricate dotwork with a vegan approach to tattooing, Pumpkeen is not only known for their stunningly precise artistry but also for maintaining the highest standards of hygiene. Clients leave with more than just a tattoo; they take away the peace of mind that comes from knowing their skin art was crafted in an environment where cleanliness is paramount.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Toulouse, Occitanie, France"
